    "question": "Given that the operator holds every credential and the record's verification has already once failed to detect deliberately falsified testimony, can any party to this deliberation demonstrate a method by which a reader could distinguish the authentic record from one the operator alone fabricated end-to-end — and if no such method exists, must the record carry that admission on its face rather than in the defect register?",
